{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16792","headline":"奉和圣制中元日题奉敬寺 · 崔元翰","name":"奉和圣制中元日题奉敬寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"妙道非本说，殊途成异名。\n圣人得其要，俱以化羣生。\n凤吹从上苑，龙宫连外城。\n花鬘列後殿，云车驻前庭。\n松竹含新秋，轩窗有余清。\n缅怀崆峒事，须继箫管声。\n离相境都寂，忘言理更精。\n域中信称大，天下乃爲轻。\n屈己由济物，尧心岂所荣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔元翰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16792.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16792","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}